   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>工具属性是现成的（手册与台账逐项录入即可），真正的工作量在<strong>落物描述结构化</strong>：铅印照片与打捞总结里的自由文本要变成「类型/外径/长度/鱼顶形态/材质/深度」六个字段。这一步做不好，后面全错。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 4 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 4</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>落物描述与图像</span><span class='cl-s'>类型、外径、长度、鱼顶形态、深度</span></span><span class='cl-n'>按落物类型标注 300—1000 例</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>打捞记录</span><span class='cl-s'>工具组合、趟数、成功率</span></span><span class='cl-n'>作为标签，失败井必须回访补录</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>井身结构</span><span class='cl-s'>套管尺寸、壁厚系列、井斜</span></span><span class='cl-n'>约束条件，逐井校核实际内径</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>工具台账</span><span class='cl-s'>型号、总成外径、适用范围</span></span><span class='cl-n'>规则库基础，需与库房库存对齐</span></div></div>"
